WEBVTT

02:02:10.417 --> 02:02:13.042
-What now? Should I thank you?
-I didn't ask you to.

02:02:13.709 --> 02:02:15.125
I won't thank you even if you ask.

02:02:15.750 --> 02:02:16.625
Thanks.

02:02:17.375 --> 02:02:19.500
I have the doctor's appointment tomorrow.

02:02:19.917 --> 02:02:20.917
Can you take me?
